{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "軫也，枝木輪也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此中前五是因，後二是果也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：心之生滅依無明成，生滅之心從本覺成，而無二體不相捨離，故為和合。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：雖有二義，心體無二。此合二義不二之心，名為棃耶識也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：棃耶識內生滅見相，名為轉\n識。於中體，名為藏識。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：當知自真名不偏在不生滅。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：以四相生起，義有前後，而從本已來，同時相依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：但\n就我執之境故說緣識，除我所執境故不說亦緣境界。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：是故無漏但隨彼染而有差別，不\n由自性有差別也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：當知無明住地非\n七識攝，亦非為彼所熏種子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：此中第五猶\n是意識，而約生後義通入意中攝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：又有處說，諸是能見通名轉識，則通八識。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：不覺義者，根本無明也。妄作境者，現識所現境也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云依顯了門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云依隱密門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記云：不覺念起是轉相也，現妄境界是現相也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別記止此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": "0200001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0200001", "type": "orig", "text": "此序依和刻本添加"}
{"id": null, "n": "0241001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0241001", "type": "orig", "text": "試疑誡"}
{"id": null, "n": "0241002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0241002", "type": "orig", "text": "（起信論疏ハ第四十五卷（No. 757）ニ會入。󴦒）"}
